   "intro": "Data underlying the \"IDD tools\" section of the Global Society for Infectious Disease Dynamics ([gsidd.org](https://www.gsidd.org)) website. This file lists **communities of practice** — networks, consortia, centres, hubs and open-source organisations — that are organised around developing, hosting or curating infectious disease dynamics (IDD) **software tools**. The test applied is whether the community's identity is built around software: a research consortium that happens to have produced a model is not included, while a group whose shared output is a tool, a package suite, a hub standard or a curated toolchain is. It is a companion to [database_tools.md](database_tools.md) (the tools themselves) and [database_ecosystems.md](database_ecosystems.md) (interoperable tool ecosystems).",
